# Python Version Consistency
RULE: Python 3.13 (>=3.13,<3.14) across pyproject.toml, Cloud Build, GitHub Actions, Dockerfile, IDE.
WHY: Prevents import/feature mismatches; unified-trading-library requires 3.10+ features.
CODEX: .cursor/rules/python-version-consistency.mdc, 06-coding-standards/dependency-management.md
DO: requires-python = ">=3.13,<3.14"; python:3.13-slim; python-version: '3.13'
NEVER: Mix 3.10/3.11/3.12 in services; use older base images
